<< /A << /BBox [ 69.4488 465.449 525.43 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Four-panel data visualization comparing heart metrics between SGLT2i and control groups. Panel A, a bar chart, shows E/e' ratio at baseline and follow-up with SGLT2i group decreasing from 12.7 to 11.2 and control group from 13.4 to 12.9. Panel B, a box plot, shows greater negative change in E/e' for SGLT2i group \(mean <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>&minus;1.51\) versus control group \(mean <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>&minus;0.5\), p <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>< 0.001. Panel C, a bar chart, shows LAVI decreasing in SGLT2i group from 42.1 to 37.2 and in control group from 39.7 to 38.7. Panel D, a box plot, shows greater negative change in LAVI for SGLT2i group \(mean <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>&minus;4.98\) compared to control \(mean <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>&minus;1.01\), p <?A3B2 show [RELSP]?>< 0.001.) /K 6 /Lang (en-EN) /P 279 0 R /Pg 162 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
